      <data key="d0">"FUNGUS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Cladosporium pseudocladosporioides T1.PL.1 is a fungus noted for substantial degradation of polyether-PU foam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cladosporium pseudocladosporioides is a fungus noted for its ability to degrade polyether-PU, resulting in substantial weight loss after incubation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cladosporium pseudocladosporioides is a type of fungus known to participate in the biodegradation of polyurethane by attacking and breaking down its chemical bonds."</data>
