    <node id="&quot;POLYLACTIC ACID (PLA)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"POLYMER"</data>
      <data key="d1">"PLA is a biodegradable plastic tested in the study alongside a supplement to observe metabolic effects on insects."&lt;SEP&gt;"PLA is a biodegradable plastic that can be consumed and broken down by mealworm larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polylactic Acid (PLA) is a type of plastic waste proposed to be managed via insect biomass production."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polylactic acid is a bio-based degradable plastic derived from renewable resources like corn starch."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polylactic Acid (PLA) is a biodegradable thermoplastic derived from renewable resources like corn starch or sugarcane."&lt;SEP&gt;"PLA is a biodegradable thermoplastic derived from renewable resources, explored in degradation protocols."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polylactic acid is a biodegradable plastic consumed by various organisms, including insects."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polylactic acid is a biobased biodegradable polymer that requires certain conditions for effective degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"PLA is a biodegradable polymer that degrades more easily compared to other plastics and is used to study biodegradation in Tenebrio molitor larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polylactic acid is a biodegradable and bioactive thermoplastic aliphatic polyester, derived from renewable resources."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polylactic Acid (PLA) is a biodegradable thermoplastic derived from renewable resources such as corn starch. It is often considered a sustainable alternative to traditional plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"PLA is a biodegradable plastic upon which mealworms and wax moths exhibit increased metabolic activity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polylactic acid (PLA), a biodegradable polymer, is degraded by yellow mealworms."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-394b3365ffb36d05dca2ef06bf74e462&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4cdbea1d06006b95d57c8b628d9e3f8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5251cc2ed910c3785b2c7242b7cbc11e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f54f1dd7372cfa3dc5f348864eed2261&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eaf641df5c55c7ff41895611514cdd22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff933f404b1e6da13d6c1319bc7432c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ce341034979daadf1f9dc7037397d1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a2991bc47bdc7fe9bc0d7c0d3e23f60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1679027e80b766e0469f7323db15b497&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92bf00317a1d0d9ffccab121661a18a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f1aa99e321e9e3b94552e6c6f8e00f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-323c02b97d9365a25761a155d358b17a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44bfda02e6c219cb097ec88543433798</data>
