      <data key="d0">"GENUS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An unclassified group within Enterobacteriaceae, notable for its dominance in the control group."&lt;SEP&gt;"This refers to unspecified members of the Enterobacteriaceae family associated with the polyether-PU-fed microbiome."&lt;SEP&gt;"Unclassified Enterobacteriaceae is a dominant genus in all-groups associated with plastic degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Unclassified Enterobacteriaceae is a dominant genus in the gut microbiomes across test groups."&lt;SEP&gt;"Unclassified Enterobacteriaceae is a prevalent genus within various experimental groups, indicating its importance in gut ecology."</data>
