      <data key="d0">"GENETIC CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"OTU refers to groups of closely related individuals identified by DNA sequencing."&lt;SEP&gt;"OTU represents a method for categorizing bacteria based on sequence data and is used to analyze microbial diversity."</data>
