    <node id="&quot;POLYESTER POLYURETHANE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Polyester polyurethane is a polymer subject to biodegradation by various microorganisms and fungi species."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polyester polyurethane is a synthetic polymer product subject to biodegradation by fungi and bacteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polyester polyurethane is a widely used synthetic polymer that is subject to microbial biodegradation by certain bacteria and fungi."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polyester polyurethane is a type of synthetic polymer that can be biodegraded by certain fungi like Aspergillus tubingenis."</data>
