      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Atrazine is a herbicide of the triazine class used to prevent pre- and post-emergence broadleaf weeds. Its interaction with microplastics affects oxidative stress and gene expression in organisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Atrazine is a herbicide studied for its combined effects with microplastics on earthworms."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-d5d8df2e13d3902379597b08eb0e08db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fb491e686c96e54f8ea43a9f1ba97eb</data>
    </node>
