      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL MARKER"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A measure of the health of coelomic cells, which can be compromised by microplastic digestion in soil organisms like earthworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Coelomocyte viability in earthworms is impacted by microplastics, affecting their immune functionality."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-6a53d37e7ff6850fc55177f325e49861&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5d8df2e13d3902379597b08eb0e08db</data>
