    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ZEBRAFISH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"MICROORGANISMS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Zebrafish are used as model organisms in studies examining the toxicity of microplastics and their biological effects."&lt;SEP&gt;"Zebrafish, a model organism in scientific research, are used to study the impact of microplastics on diet and intestinal health, demonstrating diet preference and microbiota changes."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e5caa980be616efa237401a957b69019&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fb491e686c96e54f8ea43a9f1ba97eb</data>
    </node>
