      <data key="d1">"A type of protist found in the soil, with which microplastics interact, affecting their environmental fate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Soil amoeba are simple single-celled organisms involved in soil ecology and interactions with micro- and nanoplastics."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e5caa980be616efa237401a957b69019&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bdf2753a9a78b282c1ca2c0539e3203d</data>
    </node>
