      <data key="d0">"ENZYME"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Phosphatases are enzymes that act during the biodegradation of plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Phosphatases are enzymes with significant activity in degrading different diets in mealworm larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Phosphatases is an enzyme with significant activity in mealworm larvae degrading different diets."&lt;SEP&gt;"Phosphatases are enzymes that remove phosphate groups from molecules, important for various biological processes including plastic biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Phosphatases are enzymes with significant activity in degrading different diets in mealworm larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Phosphatases is an enzyme with significant activity in mealworm larvae degrading different diets."</data>
