    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LEUCINE ARYLAMIDASE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ENZYME"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An enzyme involved in the microbial degradation of plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Leucine Arylamidase is a proteolytic enzyme with activity levels that did not significantly differ between diets and objects such as the gut or bacteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"Leucine arylamidase is among the most active enzymes in mealworm larvae during plastic degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Leucine arylamidase is an enzyme that catalyzes the hydrolysis of leucine-containing peptide bonds, playing a role in protein digestion."&lt;SEP&gt;"Leucine arylamidase is an enzyme involved in breaking down proteins and peptides by cleaving leucine residues at the end of a peptide."&lt;SEP&gt;"Leucine Arylamidase is a proteolytic enzyme with activity levels that did not significantly differ between diets and objects such as the gut or bacteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"Leucine arylamidase is among the most active enzymes in mealworm larvae during plastic degradation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2aeb4d96b02258056c16688ea13a9e90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a603837ad5b989bafd614f5eeb8504c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ddf4b13293dd3d8d0887af10fc52c98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ce1f7a057da80b206f8354c70d120c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f7eff62476fb3de27969b584ac3e605</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;Β-GALACTOSIDASE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ENZYME"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An enzyme acting during the biodegradation of plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"β-galactosidase is an enzyme with elevated activity in the digestion process of mealworm larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"β-galactosidase is an enzyme that facilitates the hydrolysis of β-galactosides into monosaccharides, and is active in Mixta tenebrionis."&lt;SEP&gt;"β-galactosidase is an enzyme that catalyzes the hydrolysis of β-galactosides into monosaccharides."&lt;SEP&gt;"β-Galactosidase is an enzyme involved in the hydrolysis of β-galactosides into monosaccharides and functions actively within this enzyme group."&lt;SEP&gt;"β-galactosidase is an enzyme with elevated activity in the digestion process of mealworm larvae."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a603837ad5b989bafd614f5eeb8504c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-146789a250a0dbaae0d8438de692e191&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ddf4b13293dd3d8d0887af10fc52c98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1c9087e78bc6ba94c2b63fd88d2ca66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f7eff62476fb3de27969b584ac3e605</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;Β-GLUCURONIDASE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ENZYME"</data>
