    </node>
    <node id="&quot;Β-GLUCOSIDASE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ENZYME"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An enzyme that facilitates the biodegradation of plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"β-glucosidase is an essential enzyme for mealworms processing cellulose and oatmeal diets."&lt;SEP&gt;"β-glucosidase assists in breaking down complex carbohydrates by cleaving the β-glycosidic bond to release non-reducing β-D-glucose."&lt;SEP&gt;"β-Glucosidase is an enzyme that facilitates the hydrolysis of β-glucosides, playing a role in carbohydrate breakdown processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"β-glucosidase is an essential enzyme for mealworms processing cellulose and oatmeal diets."</data>
