      <data key="d0">"ENZYME"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An enzyme participating in the breakdown of plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chitinase plays a role in the enzymatic degradation capabilities of mealworms on different diets."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chitinase is an enzyme that breaks down glycosidic bonds in chitin, a component of the exoskeleton of insects."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chitinase plays a role in the enzymatic degradation capabilities of mealworms on different diets."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2ddf4b13293dd3d8d0887af10fc52c98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a603837ad5b989bafd614f5eeb8504c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f7eff62476fb3de27969b584ac3e605</data>
