      <data key="d0">"PHYLUM"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Verrucomicrobia is a bacterial phylum found in the digestive tracts of mealworm larvae, with notable presence in the PS diet."&lt;SEP&gt;"Verrucomicrobia is a bacterial phylum found in the digestive tracts of mealworm larvae, with notable presence in the PS diet."&lt;SEP&gt;"Verrucomicrobia is a less abundant bacterial phylum identified in larvae fed with polystyrene diet."&lt;SEP&gt;"Verrucomicrobia is a phylum of bacteria noted in less abundance but significant in the study."</data>
