      <data key="d0">"ORDER"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Actinomycetales is an order of Actinobacteria, characterized by filamentous growth and production of antibiotics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Actinomycetales is an order of Actinobacteria, characterized by filamentous growth and production of antibiotics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Actinomycetales is an order of bacteria prevalent in larvae microbiomes across diets."&lt;SEP&gt;"Actinomycetales is an order of gram-positive bacteria with high G+C content, noted for their role in soil ecology and production of natural antibiotics."</data>
