      <data key="d0">"CLASS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A class within the Bacteroidetes phylum, identified with varied frequencies in groups."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bacteroidia is a class within the Bacteroidetes phylum, consisting of obligate anaerobic bacteria important in the human gut."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bacteroidia is a class within the Bacteroidetes phylum, consisting of obligate anaerobic bacteria important in the human gut."</data>
