      <data key="d0">"GENUS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sebaldella termitidis is a bacterial species associated with insects consuming polyethylene, affecting microbial community composition."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sebaldella termitidis is a species of bacteria that increase in prevalence when mealworm larvae are fed polyethylene."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-edad11f4e8936fcfb69f8616ad364f18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d13e8c770c847882a94a6b78b0979cc</data>
