      <data key="d2">chunk-edad11f4e8936fcfb69f8616ad364f18</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LISTERIA SPP.&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GENUS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A type of bacteria present within the gut microbiome."&lt;SEP&gt;"Listeria species are bacteria that are prevalent in mealworm larvae fed on a polystyrene-based diet."&lt;SEP&gt;"Listeria spp. is one of the most abundant bacterial taxa found in mealworms fed with polystyrene, as observed in previous research."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-14f9f0280098bb86719394a4bd53e5bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-edad11f4e8936fcfb69f8616ad364f18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f7eff62476fb3de27969b584ac3e605</data>
    </node>
