      <data key="d0">"GENUS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Nitrosira defluvii is a bacterial species observed in mealworms, particularly when fed on polystyrene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nitrosira defluvii is a nitrifying bacterium that increases in proportion when larvae consume polystyrene."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-edad11f4e8936fcfb69f8616ad364f18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d13e8c770c847882a94a6b78b0979cc</data>
    </node>
