      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL REACTION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Indoxylcarb degradation is a chemical process facilitated by enzymes like carboxylesterase in gut bacteria."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c68f3ddf96d927254424a036cd8b9acf</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MEALWORM BEETLE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANISM"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Another name for Tenebrio molitor, an insect known for its potential in biodegrading plastic waste."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mealworm beetle, or Tenebrio molitor, is studied for immune defenses and gut microbiota composition."&lt;SEP&gt;"The mealworm beetle is the adult form of Tenebrio molitor, known for their decomposing activities including plastic degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Mealworm beetle is the species Tenebrio molitor, known for its larvae that can consume Styrofoam."&lt;SEP&gt;"The adult form of mealworms, known for their role in biodegrading polystyrene through gut microorganisms."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-3351564dbd6a0ee6a8b97f6687378ffc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8b79a6f4c112b0b62ada6756140e3e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-412d934721b214c2cd0565531172171c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-086890e8567c60d8cfa7c03b0cc61f9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c68f3ddf96d927254424a036cd8b9acf</data>
    </node>
