      <data key="d0">"LIFE STAGE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Larvae of mealworm, the earlier developmental stage of Tenebrio molitor, are considered novel food in Europe and have been studied for gut bacteria."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c68f3ddf96d927254424a036cd8b9acf</data>
