      <data key="d1">"Landfill leachate treatment is a process aimed at managing and mitigating the environmental impact of leachate from landfills."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c68f3ddf96d927254424a036cd8b9acf</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BACTERIAL GUT SYMBIONTS IN ANTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bacterial gut symbionts in ants are crucial for the evolutionary development of herbivory in these insects."</data>
