      <data key="d0">"METABOLITE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A byproduct of the biodegradation of LDPE, HDPE, and PS beads by PM S1."&lt;SEP&gt;"A byproduct of the degradation of Styrofoam by microorganisms, with a retention period of under 24 hours."&lt;SEP&gt;"Carbon dioxide is a gaseous compound produced both from the thermal decomposition of Styrofoam and the mineralization by superworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"A product from the degradation of plastic by yellow mealworms, approximately 40% of the reduced plastic mass."&lt;SEP&gt;"Carbon dioxide is a byproduct of the metabolic process where EPS is biodegraded by mealworm gut bacteria."</data>
