      <data key="d1">"Additives in polymer beads potentially altered during biodegradation and analyzed through FTIR spectroscopy."&lt;SEP&gt;"Antioxidants are molecules that mitigate oxidative stress by neutralizing free radicals."&lt;SEP&gt;"Antioxidants are chemical compounds added to plastics, potentially metabolized by larvae gut microbes."</data>
