    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RNA EXTRACTION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"RNA extraction is performed on mealworms fed different diets to study gene expression changes."&lt;SEP&gt;"RNA extraction is the process of isolating RNA from biological samples for further analysis."</data>
