    <node id="&quot;KEGG&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"KEGG (Kyoto Encyclopedia of Genes and Genomes) is used for annotation and pathway mapping of DEGs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Kyoto Encyclopedia of Genes and Genomes, a collection of databases dealing with genomes, biological pathways, diseases, and drugs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Kyoto Encyclopedia of Genes and Genomes (KEGG) is a database used for understanding high-level functions and utilities of biological systems."&lt;SEP&gt;"KEGG, the Kyoto Encyclopedia of Genes and Genomes, is used for pathway mapping and gene function analysis in the study."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e69c793c3b67aed7a68bf864c2c7a309&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b693d867918f89c9b28997fe94fc830&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-718900b924b6910a58e8ead81c01c723&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f545e57b1a2b3da8601b4d23e1260c94</data>
