      <data key="d0">"ENZYME"</data>
      <data key="d1">"BRACCoX (EC 1.3.3.6) is an enzyme participating in the oxidation of acyl-CoA esters of 2-methyl-branched fatty acids, affecting metabolic processes in mealworms."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-dea2d94de229e98ea99b0d40b7b077ad</data>
