      <data key="d0">"ENZYME"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Alcohol Dehydrogenase is associated with the oxidative processes in breaking down PS and lignin."&lt;SEP&gt;"Alcohol dehydrogenase is an enzyme involved in the conversion of alcohols into aldehydes, showing overexpression in certain diets like those involving G. mellonella larvae."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-dea2d94de229e98ea99b0d40b7b077ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-158317f8eba5f6198135df044d385935</data>
