    <node id="&quot;OXYSTEROL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"METABOLITE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Oxysterol is a metabolite derived from cholesterol and acts as an inhibitor of Carboxylesterase activity in humans."</data>
