    <node id="&quot;GENE ONTOLOGY (GO)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GENETIC CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A framework used for the enrichment analysis of gene functions, revealing protein roles in PET-fed larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gene Ontology (GO) provides a framework for the model of biology that offers methods to capture and describe the attributes of genes and gene products across all species."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gene Ontology (GO) provides a framework for the annotation of genes across species, describing gene functions, processes, and cellular locations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gene Ontology (GO) terms describe the functions of gene products, with high enrichments observed in the study for activities like carboxylic ester hydrolyase activity."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-d5f4bda412174e8b173f180d9b4311ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5238515b2316265fb5cb6c6295c54e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4cdbea1d06006b95d57c8b628d9e3f8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e69c793c3b67aed7a68bf864c2c7a309</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;KYOTO ENCYCLOPEDIA OF GENES AND GENOMES (KEGG)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"KEGG is a database resource for understanding high-level biological functions from genomic data."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Kyoto Encyclopedia of Genes and Genomes (KEGG) is a collection of databases that includes information on genomes, biological pathways, diseases, and drugs."&lt;SEP&gt;"KEGG is a database resource for understanding high-level functions and utilities of the biological system, used for annotating metabolic pathways related to biodegradation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9b693d867918f89c9b28997fe94fc830&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa64e5cd2c08637934509262e56ab363&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4cdbea1d06006b95d57c8b628d9e3f8f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MEDIUM CHAIN SPECIFIC ACYL-COA DEHYDROGENASE (MCAD)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ENZYME"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An enzyme that plays a critical role in the breakdown of medium-chain fatty acids."&lt;SEP&gt;"Medium Chain Specific Acyl-CoA Dehydrogenase (MCAD) is an enzyme that catalyzes the initial step in the mitochondrial fatty acid β-oxidation pathway."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4cdbea1d06006b95d57c8b628d9e3f8f</data>
