    </node>
    <node id="&quot;POLYDISPERSITY INDEX (PDI)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOCHEMICAL MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A measure calculated to understand the molecular weight distribution in the PP samples."&lt;SEP&gt;"A measure indicating the distribution of molecular mass in a given polymer sample, which changes following depolymerization processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"PDI is a measure that indicates the broadness and distribution of molecular weight in polymers, calculated as the ratio of weight average molecular weight (Mw) to number average molecular weight (Mn)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polydispersity Index (PDI) is a measure of the distribution of molecular mass in a given polymer sample, indicating the level of uniformity in size and weight."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polydispersity Index measures the distribution of molecular mass in a given polymer sample."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polydispersity index (PDI) is a measure of the distribution of molecular weight in polymers like polypropylene, related to its biodegradability."&lt;SEP&gt;"PDI is a measure of the distribution of molecular mass in a given polymer sample, calculated as the ratio of the weight average molecular weight (M_w) to the number average molecular weight (M_n)."&lt;SEP&gt;"A measure of the distribution of molecular mass in a given polymer sample that changes after biodegradation by Tenebrio molitor larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"PDI is a measure used in polymer science to describe the distribution of molecular mass in a given polymer sample."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Polydispersity Index (PDI) is a measure of the distribution of molecular mass in a given polymer sample, indicating heterogeneity in chain lengths."&lt;SEP&gt;"The polydispersity index, calculated as PDI = Mw/Mv, measures the distribution of molecular mass in polymers during analysis."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polydispersity index is an indicator of the distribution of molecular mass in a given polymer sample, with a decrease indicating a narrower distribution."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4cdbea1d06006b95d57c8b628d9e3f8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6afbb58ebe9108893daf7e65d59fac39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e136b8a35c0d60811b9daf0cbd5729f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-152e743d95b64fab136afadf0304d459&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0cba3b06dd82e87d3b582bc21c475868&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7f79551ab9793788cd662ab66bca5ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4265fd894f71345b4ef09c26e6adbda5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-beb3c133fa4d5851f0feff55507c6874&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbc20d6948e6ca1157ecd7f80a183952&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b04ae62930e9961f964284418f1848b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f75b58db5211fc7348ccca8206b9bbae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31ad3152e855d5b8085e1e61af57515d</data>
    </node>
