      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A technique used in molecular biology to amplify and quantify DNA sequences in real time."&lt;SEP&gt;"Real-Time Polymerase Chain Reaction (RT-PCR) is a laboratory technique used to amplify and simultaneously quantify a targeted DNA molecule."&lt;SEP&gt;"Real-time Polymerase Chain Reaction is a technique used to verify differentially expressed genes related to plastic degradation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-effe1e87d51e126ff4ec5cf9e49d6524&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4cdbea1d06006b95d57c8b628d9e3f8f</data>
