      <data key="d0">"MICROORGANISMS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Tenebrio obscura is a type of mealworm capable of biodegrading polystyrene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tenebrio obscura, or dark mealworm, is a beetle species studied for its ability to biodegrade polystyrene."</data>
