    <node id="&quot;GENBANK&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A comprehensive public database of nucleotide sequences where the AlkB gene sequences for analysis were sourced from."&lt;SEP&gt;"GenBank is a comprehensive public database of nucleotide sequences used for bioinformatics analysis in the study."&lt;SEP&gt;"GenBank is a comprehensive public database of nucleotide sequences, used for sequence alignment and homology analysis of the alkB gene."&lt;SEP&gt;"GenBank is a nucleotide sequence database that is part of the NCBI suite of databases, storing genetic sequences submitted by researchers worldwide."&lt;SEP&gt;"An online database where the aligned 16S rRNA sequences were compared and stored."&lt;SEP&gt;"A nucleotide sequence database where the 16S rRNA sequences and nifH gene sequences of the mealworms' gut bacteria were deposited."</data>
