      <data key="d1">"A software tool used for performing phylogenetic analysis and inferring evolutionary relationships through various statistical models."&lt;SEP&gt;"MegaX is a software product used for conducting phylogenetic analysis, particularly utilizing various evolutionary models."&lt;SEP&gt;"Software used for constructing phylogenetic trees and molecular evolutionary analyses employing various algorithms."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-aface14c9ee7dd5ccd25e7094ed5c1c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d71b4e70d7c620ee64c709aaeae634a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51daa29515cc5a431055291627bcb199</data>
