      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A department at the University of Zimbabwe that provided reagents used in the study of plastic degradation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-678bd592bfdda3f6dd8f2a6659de7fde</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PLASTIC MIXTURES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Plastic mixtures, including polyethylene and polystyrene, are targeted for biodegradation in this study."&lt;SEP&gt;"Plastic mixtures, such as mixtures of polystyrene and polyethylene, were studied to assess the broad susceptibility of different plastics to biodegradation in mealworms."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-6bd3778dedc6a0463017df9f8d6396eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-678bd592bfdda3f6dd8f2a6659de7fde</data>
