      <data key="d1">"A mineral found in TMlp at a concentration of 1.22%, crucial for energy metabolism and bone health."&lt;SEP&gt;"Phosphorus is a chemical element detected and measured in the sample analysis."&lt;SEP&gt;"Phosphorus is an essential nutrient for plant growth, present in worm frass as an alternative fertilizer component."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-f4b03ca32b0efbf0ca6a3c8761c0d03d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb1c38c1c6dc6fea84d8f51b9f706cd2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32e10966ec80ea585746639b6be7e04e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;POTASSIUM (K)&quot;">
