      <data key="d1">"A mineral found in TMlp at a high concentration of 209.49, vital for immune function and enzyme activity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Zinc is a chemical element whose levels are noted during the material analysis."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-f4b03ca32b0efbf0ca6a3c8761c0d03d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb1c38c1c6dc6fea84d8f51b9f706cd2</data>
    </node>
