    <node id="&quot;YELLOW MEALWORM LARVAE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"MICROORGANISMS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Yellow mealworm larvae are noted for their ability to biodegrade different types of plastic, including PS and LDPE."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yellow mealworm larvae, from the Tenebrio molitor, are used as a novel nutritional component in diets for various animals like broiler chickens and pigs due to their high protein content."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yellow mealworm larvae are utilized in various studies analyzing metabolic responses to different rearing substrates."</data>
