      <data key="d1">"Accumulations of plastic waste found in marine environments, contributing to pollution and subject to degradation studies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Plastic debris refers to fragmented plastic waste present in global environments, contributing to pollution and ecological disruption."&lt;SEP&gt;"Plastic debris refers to waste materials made of plastic that exist in various sizes and forms, contributing to environmental pollution in both terrestrial and aquatic environments."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-d642e5476221b3ea202c68d7e6070b96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65434948dabde813d99972f40a04d8de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecf2c478d08c7bc8e491f630aa289881</data>
    </node>
