    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CRIDDLE CS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"RESEARCHER"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Criddle CS functions as an author in the study investigating the biodegradation processes among mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Criddle CS is a co-author involved in research efforts addressing microplastics pollution and biodegradation strategies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Criddle CS is an author linked to studies on microplastics pollution and strategies for reduction, as well as polystyrene biodegradation research."&lt;SEP&gt;"Criddle CS is associated with studies on the biodegradation capabilities of mealworm larvae regarding polystyrene."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-550dde13ffd2abcf536dd87f7d4c1b40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf7769e197cb664b8d9e41a4c93eec50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ff228c7711f94fb27152b187b1fa3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00a6288e1109e01eac1ce7ecb35f2eda</data>
