      <data key="d2">chunk-00a6288e1109e01eac1ce7ecb35f2eda</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHEMICAL AND PHYSICAL CHARACTERIZATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Chemical and physical characterization involves analyzing the structural and compositional properties of materials, like polystyrene, during biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chemical and physical characterization refers to the analysis methods used to understand the biodegradation process of polystyrene by mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the analysis of the chemical and physical properties of plastics during and after the biodegradation process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chemical and physical characterization involves analyzing the structure and properties of materials, such as plastics, to understand their breakdown mechanisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chemical and physical characterization is the method used to assess the properties and structure of materials, such as polystyrene, during biodegradation and mineralization studies."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-550dde13ffd2abcf536dd87f7d4c1b40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a31a12c930b59b872c94dda484d0db4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00a6288e1109e01eac1ce7ecb35f2eda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-422e833d3381bd5fd0b5a3d63d9047f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-276c82b9935756a3e668c788458ff922</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ROMA, ITALY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ECOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Roma, Italy is the location associated with the Food and Agriculture Organization of the United Nations, which published research on edible insects."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-00a6288e1109e01eac1ce7ecb35f2eda</data>
    </node>
