      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A central metabolic pathway involved in cellular energy production, mentioned as a context element."&lt;SEP&gt;"A central metabolic pathway that intermediates from PET degradation can enter before mineralization."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-1679027e80b766e0469f7323db15b497&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5238515b2316265fb5cb6c6295c54e8</data>
