      <data key="d0">"ENZYME"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An enzyme contributing to processes like the oxidation of ethylene glycol into glycolaldehyde and glyoxylate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dehydrogenase is an enzyme found in a higher abundance in polypropylene-fed larvae compared to control, suggesting roles in plastic degradation."</data>
