      <data key="d1">"KEGG pathways are a collection of manually curated pathways mapping genes, which include pathways involved in metabolic, genetic, and environmental processes, such as those enriched in PP degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"KEGG pathways are a collection of pathways enriched for understanding the metabolic processes during PET feed in larvae."</data>
