      <data key="d1">"Glycerophospholipid Metabolism is a significantly enriched pathway in PET-fed samples, associated with maintaining cell membrane functions and mitochondrial functions in the gut microbiome."&lt;SEP&gt;"Glycerophospholipid metabolism maintains physical properties of cell membranes and mitochondrial functions."&lt;SEP&gt;"This metabolic process is associated with repairing membrane integrity and supporting membrane function."</data>
