      <data key="d0">"NUTRIENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A rich nutrient medium used to grow bacteria and create LB agar plates by adding agar."&lt;SEP&gt;"LB medium is formulated to support bacterial growth and isolation of colonies, containing tryptone, yeast extract, and NaCl."&lt;SEP&gt;"LB medium provides nutrients like tryptone and yeast extract to enhance bacterial growth for various experiments."&lt;SEP&gt;"LB medium is a nutrient-rich medium used for the growth and maintenance of bacterial cultures in laboratory studies."&lt;SEP&gt;"LB medium is a widely used nutrient-rich medium for bacterial growth, composed of LB broth dissolved in distilled water."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-fca6acde6809ed3c727d7bffdbfd1ada&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3099f2d6fd3abc2f73550f579999b13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10004ab6a85cecf4effb74c306df57cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70bab3579af07d0f99a5f948a90fe1e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a32ea55d79e87933e26b4165db47b1fc</data>
    </node>
