      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Yang, J. is an author of studies demonstrating biodegradation of plastics by plastic-eating worms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang, J. is co-author of studies focusing on the biodegradation and mineralization of polystyrene."</data>
