      <data key="d1">"Yang, Y. is an author contributing to research on plastic biodegradation by organisms, notably mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang, Y. is one of the authors involved in the research on polystyrene biodegradation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-1a0e22d97687eaef3d31a60f7da6e668&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d97be338c51b4c4354e2d0f8de9c9dc8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WU, W. M.&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GENETIC CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Wu, W. M. is one of the researchers involved in studying the degradation of plastics by insects and microbes."</data>
