      <data key="d0">"FUNGUS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sporobolomyces roseus, from the family Sporidiobolaceae, is present in T. molitor fed on PS, indicating potential involvement in PS degradation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-681a7143730d41e569d0d76a926eb069</data>
    </node>
