      <data key="d1">"A bacterium identified as capable of biodegrading plastic waste, highlighting potential biological solutions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Brevibacillus borstelensis is a bacterium known for its potential in biodegrading plastic waste."&lt;SEP&gt;"Brevibacillus borstelensis is a thermophilic bacterium capable of degrading polyethylene, playing a role in the biodegradation of plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"A thermophilic bacterium that can biodegrade polyethylene, particularly low-density varieties."&lt;SEP&gt;"Brevibacillus borstelensis is a thermophilic bacterium capable of biodegrading polyethylene, highlighting its potential role in plastic waste management."&lt;SEP&gt;"Brevibacillus borstelensis is a thermophilic bacterium involved in the biodegradation of polyethylene."</data>
