      <data key="d1">"An intermediate developmental stage of mealworm larvae, removed during the experiment to prevent cannibalism."&lt;SEP&gt;"The life stage where insects transform from larvae to beetles, temporarily halting their consumption of plastic."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pupae refers to a developmental stage in the life cycle of Tenebrio molitor, observed after feeding experiments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pupae is the life stage into which mealworm larvae develop during the course of the experiment with different feedstocks."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pupae is the transitional life stage of T. molitor between larva and adult beetle, influenced by diet."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pupae are an intermediate life stage in the development of mealworms into beetles."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pupae represent the life stage of mealworms during which they transform before becoming beetles."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pupae represent the developmental stage in insects between larvae and adult, reared separately in mini-greenhouses during the experiment."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-f488d8d4434d57d1a775a22333caa04b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d39fc863538a777920c4eafb37bcf8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e05bc34fccfca5e177064daf8346866&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eed90a978852274ead3771418cd60bed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d7e47d05442ff6cd0cf042db9974f2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a54e547b0e77432a65a8a9804c44c5d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd3cec3addc1bee202783dff1583ba54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0638e0fe93dc27e678672a164e6088c2</data>
