      <data key="d0">"BIOCHEMICAL MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A technique applied to analyze the chemical structure and composition of plastic materials."&lt;SEP&gt;"FT-IR is a technique used to obtain an infrared spectrum of absorption, emission, photoconductivity or Raman scattering of a solid, liquid or gas."&lt;SEP&gt;"FT-IR is a technique used to characterize the functional groups in polymer samples."&lt;SEP&gt;"FT-IR is a technique used to obtain an infrared spectrum of absorption or emission of a solid, liquid, or gas, used here to characterize biodegradation."</data>
