      <data key="d1">"Microbiomes are communities of microorganisms, including bacteria, within a specific environment, such as the digestive tract of insects."&lt;SEP&gt;"Microbiomes refer to the collective microbial communities inhabiting the gut of larvae, influencing their ability to degrade plastics."</data>
