      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A location indicated as a source for T. molitor larvae in the study of plastic consumption."&lt;SEP&gt;"A location where mealworms can metabolize microplastics like PS and LDPE."&lt;SEP&gt;"Guangzhou is a city in China where mealworms were sourced in studies analyzing the decomposition of microplastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Guangzhou is a city where mealworms were collected, and these mealworms exhibited unique changes in molecular structure when metabolizing PVC and PS."&lt;SEP&gt;"Guangzhou is one of the regions where experiments with mealworms ingesting microplastics were conducted."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7ed721221326657b60aadb09faeeac92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e45f9527e7b07e945435dae572dc387&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e50d86c5a0ab8e4188ede9ae519d241&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a54e547b0e77432a65a8a9804c44c5d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-236f4db8df75799fa6a0a07921158cf0</data>
