      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A type of foam used in various applications that can be biodegraded by certain microorganisms and enzymes."&lt;SEP&gt;"A versatile foam material studied for its ignition, combustion, toxicity, and biodegradation properties."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polyurethane foams are a type of polymer known for their flexibility and use in a variety of applications, with properties that can be improved through fractionation strategies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polyurethane foams are a type of polymeric material used in various applications, including furniture and insulation, and can be degraded biologically under certain conditions."</data>
