      <data key="d1">"Surface morphology refers to the study of the structure and shape of surfaces, analyzed here for PS/CS samples with or without enzyme treatment."&lt;SEP&gt;"The study of surface features and characteristics of materials like polyurethane/clay composites in biodegradation tests."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-af9ad6e808e93b61ec40d6ba4131fda7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e8cdca8afb1d7153fba5e3c11b1f669</data>
