      <data key="d0">"PLANT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Maize is a type of plant supported by black soldier fly frass as fertilizer in agricultural studies."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-32e10966ec80ea585746639b6be7e04e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RYEGRASS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PLANT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A type of grass cultivated for its agricultural value and enriched with organic fertilizers such as black soldier fly frass."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ryegrass is a plant species shown to be supported by black soldier fly frass, highlighting the benefits of using insect frass as fertilizer."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-b79a227bc8e127f6b71fd2edb0e650a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32e10966ec80ea585746639b6be7e04e</data>
    </node>
