    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CINNAMON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"NUTRIENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Cinnamon is a food additive tested in the study to observe its impact on PS consumption by worms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cinnamon powder is used as a food additive in experiments to influence the consumption of polystyrene (PS) by superworms and mealworms."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-671dc96f9c648fdc6d21397c515d171d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12ceb4368e146509caa737d9534ce3c2</data>
