      <data key="d2">chunk-671dc96f9c648fdc6d21397c515d171d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GC-MS ANALYSIS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOCHEMICAL MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A method combining gas chromatography with mass spectrometry for analyzing metabolic intermediates in biological samples."&lt;SEP&gt;"GC-MS Analysis is a method used to analyze worm frass and carcasses for polystyrene (PS) and its by-products through gas chromatography-mass spectrometry."&lt;SEP&gt;"GC-MS Analysis is a technique used in the study to identify chemical compounds present in worm frass."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gas Chromatography-Mass Spectrometry analysis used to detect short-chain alkene semiochemicals in superworm frass."&lt;SEP&gt;"GC-MS analysis is a technique used to identify metabolic intermediates and products in PS metabolism."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gas Chromatography-Mass Spectrometry (GC-MS) analysis reveals the presence of specific chemicals in the larvae's digestive process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gas Chromatography-Mass Spectrometry (GC-MS) is used to analyze the byproducts of plastic degradation by T. molitor larvae, identifying various chemical compounds."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-078b6698be699eb7105b7cffadf709af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca86254d65e47c4049e193cf2098b964&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-671dc96f9c648fdc6d21397c515d171d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12ceb4368e146509caa737d9534ce3c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a52fc2936b4d2a771dbc2d6a37eeb710&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-582f48080aab075de76c9c590558639f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40357516e3f9dd4b2969b73efe444c28</data>
    </node>
