      <data key="d2">chunk-671dc96f9c648fdc6d21397c515d171d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DRAGON FRUIT CACTI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dragon Fruit Cacti is a plant used to test the effectiveness of worm frass as a growth medium, showing positive growth results."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon Fruit Cacti, specifically of the species Hylocereus undatus, are used in experiments to test the effects of different media, including worm frass, on their growth."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dragon fruit cacti were used in the study; their growth can vary based on the media."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-078b6698be699eb7105b7cffadf709af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44565f26e7290c5eb0f26935608a5f16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-671dc96f9c648fdc6d21397c515d171d</data>
    </node>
