      <data key="d2">chunk-5d8f385513fcff2125529486530ad5a7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HIGH-THROUGHPUT SEQUENCING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A method used to analyze the gut microbiome of yellow mealworms, revealing shifts in microbial communities."&lt;SEP&gt;"High-Throughput Sequencing is a technology that allows for the rapid sequencing of large volumes of DNA, used for community sequencing data analysis."&lt;SEP&gt;"High-throughput sequencing is a method used to analyze significant shifts in the microbial community in the Tenebrio species' gut."&lt;SEP&gt;"High-throughput sequencing is used to analyze the richness and diversity of gut microbes in Tenebrio molitor larvae."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-dad389953d78e790a40a9267c5b591c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d8f385513fcff2125529486530ad5a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7367fc6115c08ae427a6e9e91eaa1de3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-207d77d551e893eda6578be68ca3d0db</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FEEDING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Feeding refers to the process by which organisms like Tenebrio molitor consume nutrients, which can be impacted by environmental factors such as microplastics."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5d8f385513fcff2125529486530ad5a7</data>
    </node>
