    <node id="&quot;SEM IMAGES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"SEM (Scanning Electron Microscopy) images are used to observe the surface morphology of microplastics and the intestines of larvae after feeding."&lt;SEP&gt;"SEM Images refers to Scanning Electron Microscope images used to observe the surface morphology of polystyrene before and after biodegradation by mealworms."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-87427955fe47fc204be31f4d99036055&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bdc8398efba587929eebd0a0842f6e69</data>
    </node>
