      <data key="d0">"BIOCHEMICAL MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mass Spectra refers to mass spectrometry data, which provides insights into the composition of a sample, specifically for polystyrene before and after biodegradation by mealworms."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-87427955fe47fc204be31f4d99036055</data>
    </node>
