    <node id="&quot;SYNTHETIC PLASTICS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Man-made materials produced from petrochemicals, prevalent in everyday life, posing environmental challenges due to their persistence."&lt;SEP&gt;"Synthetic plastics are human-made polymers derived from petrochemicals, widely used across various industries and now subject to microbial and enzymatic degradation research."&lt;SEP&gt;"Synthetic plastics are human-made polymers derived from petroleum, extensively used in various applications."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-3aaf626f7d7f62d0cee4a0e5efafeb69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63813cc5cb4812528045bd8f1ced4313&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6aab9d327fcd7d10b5d4fbb22c03292a</data>
    </node>
