      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sequencing is the process used to analyze the V3-V4 region of the 16 S rRNA gene to identify microbial communities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The process of determining the nucleotide order of a DNA segment, used in analyzing microbial communities."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-449dceb5649c6baa34ecc2218cd3e9e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be9cf34196820cc6cfcf8a91406db608</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NANODROP&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
