      <data key="d0">"FUNGI"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Soil fungi are microorganisms living in the soil, involved in the biodegradation of synthetic polymers such as polyethylene."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-6ee089593160e720e507848fa8c917a9</data>
