      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Polyesters are a category of polymers that include biodegradable options, often explored in synthesis and environmental impact studies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polyesters are a category of polymers used in making biodegradable blends and studied for their environmental impact."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-6ee089593160e720e507848fa8c917a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a72a9944bcd114b6a3be55ad9b596c77</data>
