      <data key="d0">"MICROORGANISMS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Zophobas Atinus, commonly known as the superworm, larval stage, can biodegrade low-density polyethylene and polystyrene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Zophobas atinus is a genus of beetles in the family Tenebrionidae, whose larvae, known as superworms, are capable of biodegrading plastics."</data>
