      <data key="d1">"GPC is applied to analyze and determine the molecular weights of PS polymers."&lt;SEP&gt;"PS polymers, or polystyrene polymers, are more prone to attack and depolymerization in the mealworm gut compared to PE polymers."&lt;SEP&gt;"PS Polymers, or polystyrene polymers, are tested in various molecular weights to study their biodegradation by mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polystyrene (PS) polymers are synthetic polymers subject to reduction in molecular weight by mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Synthetic polymers that mealworms are capable of biodegrading, with varying molecular weights influencing metabolic responses."</data>
