      <data key="d0">"MICROORGANISMS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Symbionts are microorganisms that engage in a mutual relationship with their host, contributing to detoxification and the production of volatile substances."&lt;SEP&gt;"Symbionts are organisms that live in symbiosis with a host, providing mutual benefits such as nutrient exchange and protection."</data>
