    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SUGAR CONTENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"METABOLIC MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sugar content indicates the amount of sugar in the food provided to mealworms, which affects their consumption and energy levels."&lt;SEP&gt;"The sugar content in mealworms was monitored during the study to evaluate metabolic variations depending on diet."</data>
