    <node id="&quot;DICHLOROMETHANE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL PROPERTY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A solvent used for extracting polymers from frass in plastic degradation studies with PE."&lt;SEP&gt;"A solvent used to dissolve EPS feedstocks to prepare polystyrene emulsion."&lt;SEP&gt;"A solvent used to dissolve plastic pellets in the preparation of plastic emulsions for the study."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dichloromethane is a solvent used to dissolve plastic pellets during the preparation of polymer emulsions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dichloromethane was used as a solvent to prepare polystyrene emulsion for microbial degradation experiments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dichloromethane is a solvent used in the preparation of PS films by dissolving EPS."&lt;SEP&gt;"A solvent used in the preparation of PS emulsion, its evaporation plays a key role in the process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dichloromethane is used to dissolve PS foams in the preparation of PS emulsion for biodegradation studies."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-220952ca1d34f3ffef65c5d71e22015e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c808bc1867233246c6ad41186de9452&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96c2e7d253d2108b0ed94be7f2dc7466&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94bf67bf1b585ce1050569a2eb0000cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdb13eda4d3cf5385a0a8284c7e213b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ada834fc8d4bea41c0ce1770d6f57e4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-326aabc25dd967951a7845ea221532ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eafea2357c59ac6712f4d9ab41ac5d14</data>
