      <data key="d0">"BACTERIUM"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Larvae of a beetle that consume and degrade several types of plastics, including PE, PS, and PVC, making them efficient in plastic waste biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mealworms refer to the larval form of the Tenebrio molitor beetle, used in industrial and research applications."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-56af93e805daf3987d95ff99ab8e891d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe381daaa91bbff20758798e5baf82b5</data>
