    <node id="&quot;METAGENOMIC SEQUENCING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Metagenomic Sequencing is used to elucidate the response of the gut microbiome to different food sources, identifying microorganisms involved in PVC degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Technique used for sequencing the microbial DNA in the larval gut to study microbial diversity related to PET degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Metagenomic sequencing is a method used to analyze the genetic material recovered directly from environmental samples, often used in studying microbial communities."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4c426315f0f412528b9c6fb2a82dff2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-530244abdca5889849fcf86f017ebd77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-014a80fd61677e73708fa28913d7fc56</data>
    </node>
