      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The collection of microorganisms in an insect's gut, influenced by diet and responsible for various biodegradation processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"The insect gut microbiome consists of microbial populations residing in the digestive systems of insects, crucial for nutrient processing and health."</data>
