      <data key="d2">chunk-5fb00229bf45a3bd9b8a17e10a1c93d9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PY-GCMS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"PY-GCMS, or Pyrolysis Gas Chromatography-Mass Spectrometry, is used to analyze the chemical composition of PVC film."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pyrolyzer-Gas Chromatography Mass Spectrometry (Py-GCMS) is a technology used to analyze the chemical components and size distribution of residual plastic particles after biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pyrolyzer-Gas Chromatography Mass Spectrometry, a technique used to quantify small plastic components."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-02e6f7bbb2c1ef92c57b423020b0cc5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fb00229bf45a3bd9b8a17e10a1c93d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b04ae62930e9961f964284418f1848b3</data>
    </node>
