      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL PROPERTY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A medium used to culture bacterial colonies on agar plates."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2c6dfb08bb454e8ff642e7975ba7af10</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;OPTICAL DENSITY AT 600 NM (OD600)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOCHEMICAL MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A metric used to measure bacterial growth by assessing the turbidity of a culture using a spectrometer."&lt;SEP&gt;"OD600 is a measure of bacterial growth by assessing the turbidity of a culture, utilized here to track growth rates of bacterial isolates."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2c6dfb08bb454e8ff642e7975ba7af10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55bdcf1b4859e82ab15050837ab539dc</data>
