    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AGAR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A gel-like polysaccharide obtained from seaweed used in the preparation of bacteriological media such as LB agar."&lt;SEP&gt;"Agar is used in Blood Agar preparation as a solidifying agent for culture media."&lt;SEP&gt;"Agar is a gel-like substance used as a component of feeding mixtures for the larvae in biodegradation experiments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Agar is used as a control diet in the biodegradation experiments and for substrate purposes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Agar is used as an adhesive to mix with polyethylene (PE) powders in the biodegradation experiments involving larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Agar is a gelatinous substance used to solidify culture media such as LB and NPS-CFB agar."&lt;SEP&gt;"Agar is a gelatinous substance derived from seaweed, used here as a medium for feeding larvae with PE polymers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Agar is a gelatinous substance used as a mix with PE MPs during biodegradation testing, facilitating the process."&lt;SEP&gt;"A gelatinous substance derived from seaweed, used to solidify LB medium."&lt;SEP&gt;"Agar is a gel-like substance derived from seaweed, used to solidify culture media in laboratory settings."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-152e743d95b64fab136afadf0304d459&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30a7209d626a6319ba5600bea7f27299&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa33fb34ba06610c290cdfd8a5b4e916&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70bab3579af07d0f99a5f948a90fe1e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2169963c4d6dae9b98da331d39eaa72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a32ea55d79e87933e26b4165db47b1fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6f28f1c36076d1f249dbc4cd67b16f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3235cc6102d988875f1dda974a56038&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5a7fb8d6a76ecfbfc810f952bfba090&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88659f9848d30be72c37a99b551a9a0a</data>
    </node>
