      <data key="d0">"NUTRIENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Distilled water is purified water used in the preparation of many laboratory solutions and media."&lt;SEP&gt;"Distilled water is used as the solvent in Blood Agar, ensuring a pure and controlled environment for bacterial growth."&lt;SEP&gt;"Used to dilute and maintain the volume of the PS emulsion during its preparation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-fdb13eda4d3cf5385a0a8284c7e213b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a32ea55d79e87933e26b4165db47b1fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88659f9848d30be72c37a99b551a9a0a</data>
    </node>
