      <data key="d0">"PHYSICAL PROPERTY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Environmental parameters such as temperature, humidity, and light intensity affect the biodegradation process of materials like plastics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Environmental parameters such as temperature, humidity, and light intensity influence the mealworms' intake capacity and growth."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-503c588468d284ba03a34235957f9b02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88659f9848d30be72c37a99b551a9a0a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LARVA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LIFE STAGE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The larva is an immature life stage of insects, which in this text refers to the stage during which mealworms consume and biodegrade plastic."&lt;SEP&gt;"The larval stage is an early developmental phase in mealworms where feeding and growth occur."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-503c588468d284ba03a34235957f9b02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32f340b7166025be3c56178a94ae480d</data>
