      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL COMPOUND"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An inorganic chemical compound, manganese sulfate monohydrate, used as a component in the inorganic salt medium."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-70bab3579af07d0f99a5f948a90fe1e1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TRYPTONE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"NUTRIENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A component of LB medium, derived from casein, used to grow bacteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"A digest of casein, used as a nitrogen source in the preparation of Luria-Bertani (LB) medium."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tryptone is a component of LB broth providing nutrients for bacterial growth."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tryptone is an enzymatic digest of casein used as a source of amino acids and peptides in culture media."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-d3235cc6102d988875f1dda974a56038&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a32ea55d79e87933e26b4165db47b1fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6f28f1c36076d1f249dbc4cd67b16f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70bab3579af07d0f99a5f948a90fe1e1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;YEAST EXTRACT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"NUTRIENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A component of FMM medium providing nutrients for bacterial growth."&lt;SEP&gt;"A nutrient component in FMM that provides vitamins and amino acids for microbial growth."&lt;SEP&gt;"A rich source of amino acids, peptides, water-soluble vitamins, and carbohydrates, used in LB medium."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yeast Extract is part of the LB broth, supplying essential nutrients for bacterial culture."&lt;SEP&gt;"A component of LB medium that provides vitamins and other growth factors for bacteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yeast extract is used in culture media to provide a rich source of vitamins and amino acids."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-70bab3579af07d0f99a5f948a90fe1e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdb13eda4d3cf5385a0a8284c7e213b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-050a4c71685bf71165985a79f528ed58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a32ea55d79e87933e26b4165db47b1fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6f28f1c36076d1f249dbc4cd67b16f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3235cc6102d988875f1dda974a56038</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;VORTEX MIXER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A Vortex Mixer was used to agitate the homogenized gut suspension of mealworms to ensure proper mixing before culturing."&lt;SEP&gt;"A laboratory device used to mix small vials of liquid rapidly, employed in the preparation of bacterial inoculum."&lt;SEP&gt;"A vortex mixer is used to agitate a solution, ensuring even mixing of gut tissues in the suppression test."&lt;SEP&gt;"An instrument used to shake the gut tissues and suspensions to ensure thorough mixing during preparation."&lt;SEP&gt;"An instrument used to mix solutions, such as when releasing microbial contents from mealworm guts."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-10004ab6a85cecf4effb74c306df57cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70bab3579af07d0f99a5f948a90fe1e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70735757eafccc0f762f21f5d3ac8556&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3235cc6102d988875f1dda974a56038&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e37da2fbe64f85c50c36da45006f4c23</data>
    </node>
