    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PE FILM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"PE film refers to polyethylene film, used commonly in packaging. In the study, it is consumed by T. molitor larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"PE film refers to polyethylene film, used in the study both in its virgin and aged forms as a test material for biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polyethylene (PE) Film is a type of plastic used in experiments to assess its degradation by lesser waxworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polyethylene (PE) film is a type of plastic that waxworms are capable of chewing and eating."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9f2303f3680e9313daac77bb7e27e7da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bdc8398efba587929eebd0a0842f6e69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39596f0742e3d89f278017df88b8065b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-086890e8567c60d8cfa7c03b0cc61f9a</data>
