      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A statistical method used to understand the diversity and richness of gut microbiota under different experimental conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"PCA is a statistical tool used to differentiate sample clusters based on variance, here used to analyze frass content and feeding strategies."</data>
