      <data key="d0">"FATTY ACID"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Fatty acid content was analyzed in larvae to assess the effect of various diets on lipid profiles."&lt;SEP&gt;"Long-chain molecules involved in metabolic processes, discovered as products of enzymatic activity during PS biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The fatty acid content in exposure groups was analyzed using GC-MS, providing data on lipid composition in the larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fatty acids are carboxylic acids that are oxidized to release energy, especially in insects during starvation, when triglycerides are broken down."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-f71fddc259d51158d5c79f38bf41523f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a38885f67ed46b97bb84086f575fd43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b693d867918f89c9b28997fe94fc830&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f141d484320c21ec01b892a9b7d56486</data>
