      <data key="d1">"Citrobacter gillenni is a bacterium mentioned as part of the taxa descending from high-percentile nodes in the study related to Klebsiella oxytoca."&lt;SEP&gt;"Citrobacter gillenni is one of the closely related taxa identified in the phylogenetic tree, involved in polystyrene degradation."</data>
