      <data key="d0">"BIOCHEMICAL MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Indole-positive refers to a biochemical characteristic of Klebsiella oxytoca, distinguishing it from other similar species like Klebsiella pneumoniae."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-652bf0615ec39fba0cedd113ec87a78a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BOOTSTRAP PERCENTAGES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"STATISTICAL MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bootstrap percentages provide statistical confidence in the branches of a phylogenetic tree, indicating the reliability of evolutionary paths."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-652bf0615ec39fba0cedd113ec87a78a</data>
