      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"EPS is a form of polystyrene foam used in various packaging products and capable of being consumed by mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Expanded Polystyrene Foam is a common thermal insulation material used in construction that is difficult to recycle due to it being attached to other materials like bricks and mortar."</data>
