      <data key="d1">"Brickwork debris is a combination of construction materials such as bricks, mortar, and insulation which result from the demolition of brickwork buildings."&lt;SEP&gt;"Brickwork debris refers to waste material from construction that can be cleaned using Tenebrio molitor larvae."</data>
