      <data key="d1">"Cellulose biodegradation is the decomposition of cellulose material by biological agents like enzymes in Tenebrio molitor larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"The process by which mealworms degrade cellulose during their waste digestion activities."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-3351564dbd6a0ee6a8b97f6687378ffc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5ea4395a1eb1886507c72cdf33db169</data>
