    <node id="&quot;IMMUNE DEFENSES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"IMMUNE RESPONSE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Immune defenses refer to the physiological mechanisms in Tenebrio molitor that protect against pathogens and environmental stress."&lt;SEP&gt;"Immune defenses refer to the physiological processes that protect organisms, such as Tenebrio molitor, from pathogens and harmful substances."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the biological mechanisms that protect organisms, such as mealworms, from pathogens and other threats."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-412d934721b214c2cd0565531172171c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b8cc3aa81b03290b589ccf0a1548ca0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3351564dbd6a0ee6a8b97f6687378ffc</data>
