      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A statistical process used to group the feeding conditions based on their similar impacts on the development of the insects."&lt;SEP&gt;"Agglomerative Hierarchical Clustering is a clustering process used to analyze dissimilarity between different insect diets based on experimental results."</data>
