      <data key="d2">chunk-1ead6f17ad517015b638608c5bfe6852</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FATTY ACIDS (FA)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"FATTY ACID"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Fatty acids are a type of lipid serving as energy sources and critical components of cell membranes, involved in various cellular processes and PET degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fatty acids are compounds that form key components of the insect's lipid profile, analyzed across different diet-based groups."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-41b8c7f0b790b0289a7683fde0eca126&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ead6f17ad517015b638608c5bfe6852</data>
