      <data key="d2">chunk-1ead6f17ad517015b638608c5bfe6852</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;STEARIC ACID&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"FATTY ACID"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Stearic acid (C18:0) is a saturated fatty acid mentioned as part of the evaluation in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stearic acid is found in varying quantities, being higher in the OAT diet group compared to others."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stearic acid, also known as C18:0, is a saturated fatty acid frequently found in animal and vegetable fats."</data>
