      <data key="d2">chunk-7a38885f67ed46b97bb84086f575fd43</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TRISODIUM CITRATE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"METABOLITE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Trisodium citrate consumption characterizes PE diets, reflecting dietary influence on microbiota."&lt;SEP&gt;"Trisodium citrate is a salt and metabolic substance, its utilization varies among dietary treatments in larvae."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4a4712059883b356b4aea23cb7ef1514&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a38885f67ed46b97bb84086f575fd43</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INOSITOL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"NUTRIENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A compound observed for its production and its role in the PS group’s metabolism."&lt;SEP&gt;"Inositol is a carbohydrate with specific utilization patterns observed in larvae under different diets."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-84297b844ec01d2f58756b669806fd62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a38885f67ed46b97bb84086f575fd43</data>
