      <data key="d1">"Consumption of D-Melibiose in PE diets indicates specific carbohydrate metabolism pathways in the gut."&lt;SEP&gt;"D-melibiose is a sugar that is strongly utilized in the OAT diet but shows low activity in other diets."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4a4712059883b356b4aea23cb7ef1514&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a38885f67ed46b97bb84086f575fd43</data>
