      <data key="d2">chunk-ee46611b24ea3848df979ded841f06b8</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DIGESTIVE SYSTEM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Digestive System of larvae adapts to various diets, with associated microbial changes and digestive efficiency."&lt;SEP&gt;"The digestive system of Tenebrio species is responsible for the breakdown and modification of polyethylene microplastics after ingestion."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-bd73d3cca5434181ee9dd1ad1b8f8ab9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee46611b24ea3848df979ded841f06b8</data>
    </node>
