      <data key="d1">"PE diets are characterized by features like high phenylacetic acid consumption and high nifH and nirS gene abundance."&lt;SEP&gt;"PE diets refer to various polyethylene-based nutritional regimens, impacting mealworm development and the results of insect breeding."</data>
