    <node id="&quot;KJELDAHL METHOD&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A method used for determining the protein content in yellow mealworm samples."&lt;SEP&gt;"A process for determining total protein content by analyzing nitrogen content. Mineralization, distillation, and titration are key steps in this method."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Kjeldahl method is used for determining the nitrogen content in Tenebrio molitor larvae."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-eed90a978852274ead3771418cd60bed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d01d291012bd548fc067e250ec39fba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddb3edd44829125161ad624ea793ae71</data>
