    <node id="&quot;CYTOCHROME P450&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PROTEIN"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Cytochrome P450 is a group of enzymes involved in the metabolism of xenobiotics, drugs, and fatty acids in degradation pathways."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cytochrome P450 proteins are involved in metabolizing xenobiotics and aromatic compounds in insects' degradation processes."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-53d382cbd1392dbcf9530428c2eb8584&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca86254d65e47c4049e193cf2098b964</data>
