      <data key="d0">"FUNGUS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Trametes versicolor is a fungus known for its ability to degrade lignin via extracellular enzymes like lignin peroxidase, manganese peroxidase, and laccase."&lt;SEP&gt;"Trametes versicolor is a fungus that degrades lignin using multiple extracellular enzymes."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-effe1e87d51e126ff4ec5cf9e49d6524&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53d382cbd1392dbcf9530428c2eb8584</data>
