      <data key="d1">"Phanerochaete chrysosporium is a fungus capable of degrading synthetic plastics by colonizing polystyrene surfaces."&lt;SEP&gt;"Phanerochaete chrysosporium is a fungus that degrades lignin using extracellular enzymes, contributing to the breakdown of synthetic plastics with similar structures."&lt;SEP&gt;"Phanerochaete chrysosporium is a white-rot fungus known for its lignin-degrading abilities using extracellular enzymes."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-53d382cbd1392dbcf9530428c2eb8584&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-effe1e87d51e126ff4ec5cf9e49d6524&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd3cec3addc1bee202783dff1583ba54</data>
