      <data key="d1">"Anaerobic degrading bacteria are capable of breaking down natural organic polymers in an oxygen-free environment."</data>
      <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;*TENEBRIO OBSCURUS*&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"MICROORGANISMS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Tenebrio obscurus larvae are used in the biodegradation of various polyethylene grades, affecting their physiology when ingesting plastics."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-acbe3a2cb3a17985d07d15bed638bd90</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;OXIDATIVE STRESS INDICATORS&quot;">
