      <data key="d1">"Benzoquinone concentrations increased in polyethylene-fed larvae, indicating biochemical changes compared to control groups."&lt;SEP&gt;"Benzoquinone is a chemical compound produced by Tribolium confusum, analyzed for genetic production properties."&lt;SEP&gt;"Benzoquinone is observed in the larvae at the end of the test, indicating biochemical changes from the diet."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-276c82b9935756a3e668c788458ff922&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98d4ea946a931acf7e5a8292c30ea4c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-acbe3a2cb3a17985d07d15bed638bd90</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INTESTINAL TISSUE DAMAGE&quot;">
