      <data key="d2">chunk-ffb4e34985ec90215629dc19750c8bdf</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PHOTO-OXIDATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL REACTION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A chemical alteration of a substance caused by light, often used as a pretreatment for PE to enhance biodegradability."&lt;SEP&gt;"A chemical process facilitated by light, often used to initiate the breakdown of polymers like polyethylene in the presence of pro-oxidant additives."&lt;SEP&gt;"Photo-oxidation is a chemical reaction that helps initiate the biodegradation process by breaking down plastics under light exposure."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-694aaaa7c2839ea048d46b6a2bb13748&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1d3c25b9affee2f535cb531a09a2384&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffb4e34985ec90215629dc19750c8bdf</data>
    </node>
