      <data key="d1">"PE-MPs are polyethylene microplastics assessed for their impact on oxidative stress, microbial interactions, and possible biodegradation by larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polyethylene microplastics (PE-MPs) are the subject of extraction and analysis to study their biodegradation in larvae."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9b693d867918f89c9b28997fe94fc830&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa33fb34ba06610c290cdfd8a5b4e916</data>
