    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RCBRAY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"RCBray is a measure used to determine the degree of 'dispersal limitation' within a microbial community, assessed to be greater than 0.95 and correlated with a 6% dispersal limitation."</data>
