    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MP&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PHYSICAL FEATURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"MP refers to microplastics, particles larger than 2 micrometers formed during the biodegradation of plastic foams."&lt;SEP&gt;"Microplastics are small plastic particles that cause stress responses, tissue damage, and toxic effects in various organisms when exposed."</data>
