      <data key="d0">"NUTRIENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A pre-treatment nutrient used in experiments to observe its effect on EPS consumption rates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lemon-Lime Soda was applied as a pre-treatment to determine its influence on mealworm consumption of EPS."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lemon-lime soda is used as a pre-treatment for EPS, enhancing mealworm consumption rates due to its acidity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lemon-lime soda is used as a pre-treatment for EPS, increasing the biodegradation rate when consumed by mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lemon-lime soda is used as a pre-treatment solution for EPS cups to observe its effects on mealworm consumption."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7b33a3915745323f1bd29bd2febf60b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1d76ad321e1c68d5f139cdb94d5bf42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09d03c0a2dce3f57876d209a83a2e82a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b2f11b2dff6f9e39c409f2bbd26c9d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c11c77665793ac79aecfb19a89dd1f52</data>
