      <data key="d1">"Tomato Paste was used as a pre-treatment to see its effect on EPS consumption rates in mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tomato paste is another pre-treatment tested on EPS to determine its effect on the biodegradation rate by mealworms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tomato paste is used as a pre-treatment for EPS to increase mealworm consumption rates, possibly due to acidity or additional nutrients."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tomato paste is utilized as a pre-treatment for EPS cups to investigate its impact on the mealworm feeding process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Used in pre-treatment conditions in experiments to study its impact on mealworm EPS consumption."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7b33a3915745323f1bd29bd2febf60b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1d76ad321e1c68d5f139cdb94d5bf42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09d03c0a2dce3f57876d209a83a2e82a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b2f11b2dff6f9e39c409f2bbd26c9d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c11c77665793ac79aecfb19a89dd1f52</data>
    </node>
