      <data key="d0">"MICROORGANISMS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Z. atratus is a larvae species utilized in studies to understand biodegradation, being fed materials like Styrofoam and wheat bran."&lt;SEP&gt;"Zophobas atratus is studied for its consumption of polystyrene when combined with dietary supplements like wheat bran."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-260d8c268067de32e5ac98d66ab70a6c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a3e42eecd3967a9e53cfadc926363ee</data>
