      <data key="d1">"Study indicating survival rates of habitats with polystyrene and bran co-nutrient affecting mealworm life span."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang et al. (2018c) refers to a scientific study that examined the role of gut bacteria in the biodegradation of polystyrene by mealworms, utilizing various analytical methods to monitor degradation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-260d8c268067de32e5ac98d66ab70a6c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b2f11b2dff6f9e39c409f2bbd26c9d9</data>
