      <data key="d1">"A solid growth medium that supports bacterial growth, used in conjunction with LB medium in experiments."&lt;SEP&gt;"LB Agar is a medium used for the growth and physiological study of the bacterial isolates in the document."&lt;SEP&gt;"LB Agar is a nutrient-rich medium used to grow bacteria, providing essential nutrients for bacterial growth and facilitating various microbiological studies."&lt;SEP&gt;"LB agar is a nutrient-rich medium used for the cultivation of Mixta tenebrionis, supporting its growth and colony formation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Luria-Bertani agar is a nutrient-rich medium used for the cultivation of bacterial strains such as LG3."</data>
