      <data key="d0">"BIOCHEMICAL MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Lipidomics is the large-scale study of pathways and networks of cellular lipids in biological systems, here used to study breast cancer."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lipidomics is the large-scale study of pathways and networks of cellular lipids in biological systems, proposed for further plastic degradation analysis."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lipidomics is the study of cellular lipids on a wide scale, which was applied to understand the cellular lipid alterations during polystyrene biodegradation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-d8e18d03240e025c60621d616f1de85b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5922f60fcd06ac6ffa27018026871346&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c6ced866009d759592c16009bc619b4</data>
