      <data key="d0">"TOOL/TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A tool used to analyze the taxonomy of 16S rRNA gene sequences against a database."&lt;SEP&gt;"RDP Classifier is a tool used for classifying rRNA sequences for microbiome analysis."&lt;SEP&gt;"RDP Classifier is a tool used to assign taxonomy to ribosomal RNA sequences by comparing them against a known database, aiding in microbial community analysis."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a38c714e7f1f701ec1149e25910e16e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7f79551ab9793788cd662ab66bca5ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6f28f1c36076d1f249dbc4cd67b16f1</data>
