    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HUMAN DISTAL GUT MICROBIOME&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"MICROBIOME"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The community of microorganisms residing in the distal part of the human gastrointestinal tract, studied through metagenomic analysis."&lt;SEP&gt;"The human distal gut microbiome is the community of microorganisms living in the distal part of the human intestine, crucial for various physiological and metabolic processes."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-648afbc8ee82935d4026f5915152491c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3667703f7416ebab666e65b375dd8582</data>
    </node>
