      <data key="d1">"A bacterial strain isolated from yellow mealworm gut, capable of degrading PS films through microbial action."&lt;SEP&gt;"WJ2020 is a bacterial strain identified as being able to degrade PS and grow on it as a sole carbon source."&lt;SEP&gt;"WJ2020 is a bacterial strain originating from the gut of Tenebrio molitor, involved in the degradation of Polystyrene (PS) resulting in substantial weight loss over time."&lt;SEP&gt;"WJ2020 is a bacterium that has been identified as part of the genus Klebsiella and is capable of degrading PS films through oxidation."</data>
