    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PROBIOTICS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"NUTRITIONAL COMPONENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Probiotics consist of live bacteria that are beneficial to immune health and are often utilized in dietary health strategies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Probiotics influence the gut microbiome and are known for their beneficial effects on microbial-produced metabolites in pigs."</data>
