    <node id="&quot;NITROGEN CONTENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOCHEMICAL MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Nitrogen content is used in conjunction with a conversion factor to calculate the total crude protein content in samples."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nitrogen content refers to the amount of nitrogen present in a sample, relevant for calculating protein content."&lt;SEP&gt;"The nitrogen content in mealworm frass decreased when the larvae were fed a diet including polystyrene, indicating stress or altered metabolic processes."</data>
