      <data key="d0">"FUNGUS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A plastic-eating species capable of biodegrading polyethylene (HDPE) waste, frequently studied in environmental science."&lt;SEP&gt;"The lesser waxworm is a caterpillar of interest for its ability to degrade polyethylene and its life cycle, contributing to the plastic degradation process."&lt;SEP&gt;"The lesser waxworm is the larval form of Achroia grisella, a species studied for its capability to degrade high-density polyethylene (HDPE) and complete its life cycle on this diet."</data>
