      <data key="d1">"Alcoholic groups, also known as hydroxyl groups, are functional groups consisting of an oxygen and a hydrogen atom bound together, noted in the polyethylene biodegradation process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Chemical groups featuring an -OH moiety, observed as a new presence in the chemical analysis of degraded polyethylene."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-eecad183fc5700f3d7e0a266e293de1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9bd8cf0d5102bbca724e0773be0eeae</data>
