      <data key="d2">chunk-5af82472112cbc9e76b1fd1ac6e8c54e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PE-WC CO-FEED&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DIET"</data>
      <data key="d1">"PE-WC co-feed refers to the diet composed of polyethylene and waxcomb fed to lesser waxworms to evaluate biodegradation efficiency."&lt;SEP&gt;"The PE-WC Co-feed consists of a mix of polyethylene and waxcomb in equal proportions, provided to lesser waxworms to study their feeding preferences and degradation capabilities."</data>
