      <data key="d0">"BACTERIUM"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bacteria located in the digestive tract of Achroia grisella larvae, potentially responsible for breaking down polyethylene within the gut."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bacteria present in the digestive tract of certain larvae, capable of breaking down polyethylene."</data>
