      <data key="d1">"Molecular weight changes refer to the variations in polypropylene's molecular structure after passing through larvae digestion."&lt;SEP&gt;"Molecular weight changes refer to variations in the weight of polymers measured in this study, indicating the effectiveness of biodegradation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-b2d6bcd4d2cc81a978694e417e76747e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26a193cc62c03cb6460b0434df42d8c8</data>
