      <data key="d0">"SCIENTIFIC REFERENCE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A study demonstrating that mealworms can survive on EPS alone, converting a portion into CO2, highlighting microbial involvement in PS degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Reference to a previous study that examined PS depolymerization in larvae, highlighting differences in microbe dependence."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yang et al. (2015a) is another reference to earlier experimental work related to T. molitor larval rearing."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-843d5746868067bce1a2f15dfc1571e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6dcd4cd232a018bcab118acc67b3f0f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38e212e8bab88c4d7b6d63a157e27c00</data>
