      <data key="d2">chunk-53dd546535ef4247004faab1fa475889</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SR (SURVIVAL RATE)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"HEALTH MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"SR indicates the survival rate of mealworms when fed with different types of PS materials, measuring the effectiveness of PS as a food source."&lt;SEP&gt;"SR reflects the survival percentage of mealworms under various feeding conditions, including PS, bran, and unfed controls."&lt;SEP&gt;"Survival Rate (SR) measures the percentage of larvae that survive under various dietary conditions."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0638e0fe93dc27e678672a164e6088c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd3092744be0c66dad5833977dedd913&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc6b858a4eb57553f5b1ae041e1c7160</data>
    </node>
