      <data key="d0">"BIOCHEMICAL MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The B:PS ratio indicates the proportion of bran to polystyrene in the mealworm diet, affecting the extent of polystyrene degradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The B:PS ratio refers to the ratio of bran to PS, influencing the degradation rate of PS by mealworms."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-dc7f923e7edaa7bcfa79c0f7a9896e00&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc6b858a4eb57553f5b1ae041e1c7160</data>
