      <data key="d2">chunk-eed90a978852274ead3771418cd60bed</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CO2 MINERALIZATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL REACTION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"CO2 mineralization is a chemical process involved in converting carbon dioxide into organic matter, investigated for its effect on polystyrene and mealworms."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-eed90a978852274ead3771418cd60bed</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ADF-N&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOCHEMICAL MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"ADF-N denotes the portion of nitrogen bound in acid detergent fiber, relevant in correcting protein content calculation for non-protein nitrogen."&lt;SEP&gt;"ADF-N refers to acid detergent fiber nitrogen, which is subtracted from total nitrogen content to improve the accuracy of protein measurements."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-eed90a978852274ead3771418cd60bed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbf28f07f3e46b29e447aae784667c29</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DISTILLATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Distillation is a purification process in the Kjeldahl method, separating volatile components to isolate nitrogen compounds."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-eed90a978852274ead3771418cd60bed</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TITRATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL REACTION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Titration is the final step in protein content analysis in the Kjeldahl method, involving a solution to determine the amount of nitrogen."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-eed90a978852274ead3771418cd60bed</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CONVERSION FACTOR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BIOLOGICAL CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A conversion factor of 6.25 is used to calculate crude protein content from nitrogen content, allowing comparison between studies."&lt;SEP&gt;"The conversion factor is used to translate nitrogen content into protein content, with specific factors for different organisms."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-eed90a978852274ead3771418cd60bed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbf28f07f3e46b29e447aae784667c29</data>
    </node>
