      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"GC-MS is a technique used to identify the depolymerization products and chemical changes in the plastic after biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"GC-MS is a technology used to identify intermediates and products generated from the biodegradation of plastic."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c6dce72fccb3df94ec407aba3d4df8eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39596f0742e3d89f278017df88b8065b</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHLOROFORM:METHANOL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL COMPOUND"</data>
