    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TRICHODERMA VIRIDE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"FUNGUS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Trichoderma viride is a fungus known for its ability to degrade plastic, isolated from landfill soil."&lt;SEP&gt;"Trichoderma viride is a soil fungus capable of plastic degradation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5f99668e767a56e2e64ece791653b952&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9095195e9cf06b9887c03abde6284d8</data>
