    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GREGARINES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"MICROORGANISMS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Gregarines are apicomplexan parasites typically found in the intestines of invertebrates, mentioned in context of the Coleoptera's gut."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gregarines are parasites found in the guts of Coleoptera, noted in studies of gut ecosystems."</data>
