      <data key="d2">chunk-03f2fc4d98412efb8a792474cc47e558</data>
      <data key="d1">"Esterase shows a synergistic effect with amidease in the enzymatic recycling of thermoplastic polyurethanes."</data>
      <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;POLYPROPYLENE FOAM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Polypropylene foam is a type of polypropylene used as a sole diet in the study to test the biodegradation capabilities of insect larvae."</data>
