      <data key="d0">"PHYSICAL PROPERTY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Number-Average Molecular Weight (M&lt;sub&gt;n&lt;/sub&gt;) is a measure of the average molecular weight of a polymer, indicative of depolymerization extent."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-f5613b129e38cb777855c04f228fe7e9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WEIGHT-AVERAGE MOLECULAR WEIGHT (M&lt;SUB&gt;W&lt;/SUB&gt;)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PHYSICAL PROPERTY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Weight-Average Molecular Weight (M&lt;sub&gt;w&lt;/sub&gt;) reflects the molecular weight distribution, used to evaluate changes in polymers like polypropylene."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-f5613b129e38cb777855c04f228fe7e9</data>
    </node>
