      <data key="d0">"PHYSICAL PROPERTY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Size-Average Molecular Weight (M&lt;sub&gt;z&lt;/sub&gt;) is a measure of polymer size distribution, important in analyzing polypropylene degradation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-f5613b129e38cb777855c04f228fe7e9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;POLYOLEFIN FAMILY OF POLYMERS&quot;">
