    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NITROGEN AMBIANCE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL PROPERTY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A high-purity nitrogen ambiance is used as a controlled environment during thermal analysis processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"An environment with high-purity nitrogen used in thermal analysis."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-f3099f2d6fd3abc2f73550f579999b13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4265fd894f71345b4ef09c26e6adbda5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;METTLER TOLEDO TGA/SDTA851E&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An instrument used for thermal analysis of PP foam and frass samples."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4265fd894f71345b4ef09c26e6adbda5</data>
    </node>
