      <data key="d1">"A substance used to suppress bacteria, particularly noted here for its role in inhibiting gut activities and depolymerization processes within larvae."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gentamicin is an antibiotic used to suppress bacterial activity, affecting the gut microbiota in experimental treatments."</data>
