      <data key="d1">"A species of earthworm known to ingest and fragment polyethylene microplastics, contributing to biodegradation through soil interaction."&lt;SEP&gt;"Eisenia andrei, a species of earthworm, is known to generate nanoparticles (NPs) in its hindgut after exposure to specific sizes of polyethylene (PE) microplastics (MPs)."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-02e6f7bbb2c1ef92c57b423020b0cc5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84a8f1c256b1141b6bd2b404e817dfb7</data>
    </node>
