      <data key="d1">"Polymer molecular weight, including number-average, weight-average, and size-average, is a key measure in characterizing the plastics used in the study."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0cba3b06dd82e87d3b582bc21c475868</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THERMOSTATIC INCUBATOR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The thermostatic incubator is used to maintain consistent temperature and humidity conditions for mealworm breeding during the study."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0cba3b06dd82e87d3b582bc21c475868</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EA-IRMS&quot;">
