      <data key="d2">chunk-cb1740bb657b0f90c48ee5e6d75945ce</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GRINDING RATE CONSTANT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"METABOLIC MEASURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Grinding rate constant (k2) is a parameter in the model that indicates the rate at which plastics are mechanically reduced in size."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-cb1740bb657b0f90c48ee5e6d75945ce</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SPSS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"SPSS is a software used for statistical analyses, utilizing methods such as the Kolmogorov–Smirnov test to compare size distributions of particles."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-cb1740bb657b0f90c48ee5e6d75945ce</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PLASTIC COMPONENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
