      <data key="d0">"MICROORGANISMS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Spodoptera frugiperda larvae, also known as fall armyworms, are proposed for research into their interaction with microplastics."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-17052974ec1c317689bf07f0684f130f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NANO-SIZED PLASTICS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Nano-sized plastics refer to extremely small plastic particles not generated in mealworm studies due to rapid biodegradation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-17052974ec1c317689bf07f0684f130f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INTESTINES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PHYSICAL FEATURE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Intestines in mealworms are the site where digestion and biodegradation of microplastics occur."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-17052974ec1c317689bf07f0684f130f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LIGHT RED COLOR&quot;">
