      <data key="d1">"Petro-based major polymers such as PE, PS, and PVC are investigated in the study for their biodegradation by mealworms."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-17052974ec1c317689bf07f0684f130f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BIO-BASED DEGRADABLE PLASTICS&quot;">
