      <data key="d1">"A biodegradable thermoplastic derived from renewable resources, studied for microbial adhesion and interaction with oxytetracycline."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polylactic acid microplastics are small particles of biodegradable polymer plastic affected by microbial adhesion and degradation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-779ca6b59945309c6bf5040c9fb474ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-825c2784fa66ce67114e4173ed0702f9</data>
