      <data key="d1">"Broad depolymerization (BD) is a typical pattern of polymer degradation involving the breakdown of a wide range of molecular weights."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-67028993c2650049216602d03fb3f786</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LIMITED-EXTENT DEPOLYMERIZATION (LD)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CHEMICAL REACTION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Limited-extent depolymerization (LD) represents a pattern where only certain portions of polymer chains are broken down, often affecting smaller molecules preferentially."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-67028993c2650049216602d03fb3f786</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COMMERCIAL PS FOAMS&quot;">
