acilitating the breakdown process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tenebrio molitor larvae are utilized for the biodegradation of polymers like polystyrene and polyethylene, demonstrating their role in depolymerization processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tenebrio molitor larvae participate in the biodegradation of polystyrene, breaking it down into simpler compounds."</data>
