    <edge source="&quot;BRAN&quot;" target="&quot;MEALWORM LARVAE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">48.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Bran is mixed with polyethylene to improve mealworm larvae's digestion efficiency and overall nutrient uptake."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bran supplementation in mealworm larvae diets affects their ability to biodegrade polyethylene, showing an interaction between diet and plastic decomposition."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bran supplementation in the diet of mealworm larvae enhances their biomass and survival while affecting polyethylene biodegradation efficiency."&lt;SEP&gt;"Co-feeding mealworm larvae with bran and polyethylene shows enhanced plastic consumption due to additional carbon sources."&lt;SEP&gt;"Supplementing bran in the diet enhances the biomass and survival of mealworm larvae, indicating a positive nutritional benefit."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mealworm larvae fed with bran show the highest fatty acid content and optimal fatty acid ratios according to the study."</data>
      <data key="d5">"co-diet, consumption enhancement"&lt;SEP&gt;"diet influence, biodegradation efficiency"&lt;SEP&gt;"diet supplementation, nutrient uptake"&lt;SEP&gt;"feed efficiency, nutritional optimization"&lt;SEP&gt;"nutrition, growth support"&lt;SEP&gt;"nutritional supplementation, survival impact"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-fccc204d8a48c645da49bd7b3175c262&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f54f1dd7372cfa3dc5f348864eed2261&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a660790845c6a68ed38b428a7756fc84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa1a88a43b40afd043514c5f6898ee71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1175f4bdc5e5c267806fa6c0ff19fcc4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f7d44b3f99233bb4389ceea0cd62617</data>
