      <data key="d3">27.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Mealworms consuming PVC adds to understanding their potential in plastic biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The crystalline structure of PVC changed after being metabolized by mealworms from Tai'an and Shenzhen."&lt;SEP&gt;"The metabolic capability of mealworms from various regions differently affected the crystalline structure of PVC, highlighting selectivity in biodegradation."&lt;SEP&gt;"PVC experiences less consumption by mealworms, showing it is not as preferred as PS or PP."</data>
